! in H2O2 molecule using Dirac-Coulomb (dc) Hamiltonian
!
! Please note that the basis-set is far from being appropriate, just for demonstration.
! Note also that this property is very sensitive to numerical noise and demands good SCF,
! response convergence and highly depends on the nuclear model, the basis set quality
! and the kinetic balance prescription.
